We brought to life 10 year old Jasmine's slime firing superhero suit. Here's how we made it & how it faired in a superhero battle!

A massive thank you to the Institution of Mechanical Engineers for supporting this challenge, check out their STEM at Home activites https://www.imeche.org/careers-education/stem-at-home

